{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ed01b59d-6b3f-848a-8465-efa0821db2e1",
  "created_at": "2026-03-13T12:04:06-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ivan Spencer",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T12:03:04-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa Delgado. ¿Cómo le puedo ayudar?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T12:03:08-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. Sorry, I'm whispering. Someone's sleeping here. Is this the Registry? Motor Vehicles?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T12:03:13-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, sir, this is the City Clerk at Newport City Hall. The Registry is a state office. Different number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T12:03:19-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. [pause] I thought, um, I thought I dialed the right one. I used the area code from the old paperwork. Isn't it 401 for everything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T12:03:27-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one covers the whole state, so the area code's fine. It's the rest of the number that's off. Best thing is to look up the Registry on the state website, or check the number on your renewal notice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T12:03:39-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So the area code isn't the problem. I must've transposed something. Fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T12:03:44-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Probably so. It happens a lot around lunchtime, honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T12:03:47-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. I was doing this as part of a clean-up. New Year's plan, finally clearing out the closet, found the old notice in there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T12:03:55-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, good for you. Hopefully the notice has the right number on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T12:04:00-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll check. Thanks. Sorry to bother you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T12:04:03-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No bother. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
